                <pb facs="0466" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg342"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.51 Refugee Settlement Commission/64:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Special Mission at
                            Lausanne to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lausanne</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-06-15T18:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15, 1923—6
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 15—3:40
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>428. Department’s 182, June 13, 11 a.m. First meeting of Finance Committee of the
                    League of Nations will be held June 21st. I have written a letter to the
                    president of the committee in which I refer to the suggestion made to the
                    Department of State that Dolbeare is ready to attend the meetings insofar as
                    they relate to emergency relief.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
